# Copy to .env.development and .env.production, or leave both out entirely.
#
# VITE_PROXY_URL points at the demo-key Worker in ../proxy. When it is set, a
# visitor with no API key of their own borrows a shared, rate-limited Gemini key
# and everything works on first load; the key itself never reaches the browser.
#
# Leave it unset and the app is pure bring-your-own-key: generation, indexing,
# captions and workflow capture all wait for a key entered in the header, and
# the header shows an "Add Gemini key" control. Both are valid builds — but a
# deployment that means to be try-it-now and forgets this variable looks broken
# in exactly that way, so set it deliberately rather than by accident.
#
# This is a URL, not a credential. The secret lives in the Worker.
VITE_PROXY_URL=https://perpetual-proxy.cognitivelab-tech.workers.dev
